                <Fragment slot="title">1. Do I need a new website or a redesign?</Fragment>
                <p>
                  A redesign is usually appropriate when the existing website foundation can still
                  support the business but the message, structure, visual experience or customer
                  journey needs improvement. A new build makes more sense when the current system
                  cannot support the required functionality or long-term direction.
                </p>
              </Accordion>
