                  WooCommerce stores, while Shopify is designed specifically around managed
                  e-commerce. The right choice depends on your business model, catalogue,
                  integrations, team and long-term requirements.
                </p>
              </Accordion>
              <Accordion class="faq-3 accordion is-closed block flex-block">
