                  work can focus on the areas that are holding the website back rather than
                  rebuilding everything unnecessarily.
                </p>
              </Accordion>
              <Accordion class="faq-4 accordion is-closed block flex-block">
                <Fragment slot="title">4. What if I am not sure what platform I need?</Fragment>
